# GAME ASSET PACK — PROJECT PHONIX

Create a complete 2D game asset pack.

Game:
Retro Arcade Space Shooter

Style:
Classic Arcade Pixel Art

Global Rules:
- Top-down view
- Pixel art only
- Transparent background (except background asset)
- Crisp pixel edges
- Clean silhouettes
- Symmetrical design where appropriate
- No anti-aliasing
- No blur
- No realism
- No 3D
- No text
- No UI
- 8–16 colors maximum
- Strong readability at gameplay scale
- Consistent visual language across all assets
- Keep safe padding around sprite edges
- Export PNG

Color Direction:
Blue → Player
Red / Orange → Enemies
Green → PowerUps
Dark Blue → Environment
Yellow / White → Effects

